    {
      "id": "why-sfn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "DESIGN CHOICE: Step Functions\n- Decouples logic from compute\n- Ensures Dim merges finish before Fact loads\n- Native retry handling for transient API errors",
